{comment: Strophe 3}
Be-[Am]fore the boat had [Am]hit the water
The [Dm]whale's tail came [Am]up and caught her
All [Am]hands to the side, har-[Am]pooned and fought her
[E]When she dived down [Am]low (huh)

{comment: Refrain}
